    "After explicit renderer pause/resume, the same original Connection again receives decoded audio without a media renegotiation or mutation.",
    "Exactly9 unique logical mutations in the audio-only fallback scene; SQL confirms2 completed media offers and0handoffs. The existing WT handoff/explicit WSS preparation-refusal scene still passes unchanged scope.",
